{"reviews":[{"id":"B0982TYDMK-0","r":5.0,"t":"Small bag","x":"The bag is about the size of a bag of chips","h":70,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-1","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely","x":"One bag makes a whole lot. It\u2019s not too greasy - wonderful consistency on its own.","h":53,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-2","r":3.0,"t":"What was I thinking? But not all bad","x":"Just got my order today and i was very excited! Until I saw how small it was! Not sure what i thought 10oz was going to look like but for the very steep price i imagined it being bigger. On the more positive note the product is self is great! It had a very very mild chemical smell but nothing major it faded when i put it on. The shine is nice not too poppin but it pops! Ita just the righ consistency right out the bag i feel like adding high amounts of other oils will thin it out too much. Its be","h":41,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-3","r":4.0,"t":"Ok but pricey!","x":"Not thick enough.! Love that it doesn't have a unpleasant smell. Wasn't a fan of the cost. Found it cheaper some where else.","h":32,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-4","r":2.0,"t":"Terrible","x":"This is way smaller than 10 oz. and the versagel came busted","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-5","r":1.0,"t":"Lipgloss base","x":"This is a rip off !!!!!!! 27 dollars for a little ass really tiny asss bag of lipgloss base.... your better off buying the amazon diy kit getting the lipgloss base out of that because this a rip off","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-6","r":4.0,"t":"diy lip gloss base","x":"a clear plastic bag filled with base for lip gloss the bag itself is quite flimsy and isnt good for long term use i actually had to put it in a different container. the base itself was absolutely wonderful it mixes really well without leaving a chunky consistency like some other bases do. It is a bit on the expensive side considering its a smaller container and unless i couldnt find a cheaper alternative im not sure i would purchase it again but definitely worth the money I invested into it. I w","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-7","r":5.0,"t":"Poppin","x":"[[VIDEOID:2b8ed414d378baff273e1552d01e068]] Not as glossy as I like my lip gloss to be but I know the trick for that. Besides that, lip gloss is definitely a win win. Made more than about tubes","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-8","r":5.0,"t":"This is THE BEST lip gloss base","x":"This is my absolute favorite lip gloss base. I used it for the first time and don\u2019t want to use any other. This is absolutely amazing and way underpriced!!! It\u2019s the best !!","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-9","r":5.0,"t":"Best base I\u2019ve ever worked with!!","x":"I honestly loved this so much more than the TKB. The base is magical and easy to work with. It\u2019s not thick or runny. Just right! My lip glosses came out beautiful for my vending event and my store (Armenea\u2019s) inventory. One bag filled 20+ tubes for me. I currently have over 100 tubes fill with plenty more to fill. And still some left over. You definitely get your money\u2019s worth.  I\u2019m already a frequent buyer and will definitely be buying more of this.  I wish there was a bucket option lol","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-10","r":5.0,"t":"Small bags but powerful","x":"I purchased two of these 10oz bags..they're incredibly small however it goes a long way. I was able to fill 50 20 ml lip gloss tubes with two bags. the rubbing alcohol and dawn did not get the oil off my hands.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-11","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect !!","x":"Just what i needed. Will be buying again! Smooth, glossy, not sticky!","h":13,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-12","r":2.0,"t":"Size and Amount","x":"It was really small for what u pay for and overall is just a rip off in my opinion waste of my money.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-13","r":4.0,"t":"It's not TKB","x":"This base isn't thick to start. So the more you add the thinner it will become.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-14","r":4.0,"t":"love this","x":"this is a amazing lip loss great for a small business","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-15","r":5.0,"t":"Would Buy Again, Recommend\ud83d\udc4d","x":"I\u2019ve seen reviews about it and was kinda worried for a bit but honestly speaking, some reviews said it\u2019s small or 10 oz is not enough. That\u2019s why you have to look carefully and read it FULLY. It tells you the size of the bag \ud83e\udd28 I weighted mine when it came in and it was 10 oz ( it was a bit more ) then some said about the gloss. it tells you in the description of A and B on the front or on the descriptions again. Also with the lip glosses, it all depends on what other products you put in it and h","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-16","r":5.0,"t":"very big, money worth","x":"haven\u2019t used yet but it\u2019s a good size this is what i was looking for !","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-17","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible","x":"This product too watery to make lipgloss. It is not thick at all. Plus this bag isn\u2019t a 10oz bag. Wasted my money with this product.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-18","r":3.0,"t":"Not worth it.","x":"I bought this because it was going to get here sooner than the TKB trading lipgloss base and it was definitely not worth the money. This stuff is so liquidy. The shine is alright but it\u2019s just not the \u2018lipgloss\u2019 base you anticipate. The size was also so small! For all that money. For those of you trying to picture how much 10 oz is, picture 3 travel size shampoos. that\u2019s roughly what it is. You can\u2019t even make it your own lipgloss by adding your oils or coloring. If you add any of your oils that","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-19","r":3.0,"t":"Not good value for money","x":"For the price, it is not a good value. It would be best to just purchase from TKB Trading. I received my versagel today and was able to fill six 5ml tubes, nine 10ml tubes and fifteen 1.2ml sample tubes. The texture of this base is much more loose and more watery than other versagel I\u2019ve used. As soon as I received this, I just opted to spend the $60 to get the 3.5 lb bag. There is no point in being continuously disappointed when a versagel package arrives and it is only a few ounces.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-20","r":5.0,"t":"10/10 Would recommend this product","x":"I absolutely 100% will never buy another lip gloss bass again this one is perfect you don\u2019t have to add any oils it\u2019s so easy you just put it in a cup or bowl add your pigment and you\u2019re done absolutely love this lip gloss base","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-21","r":2.0,"t":"A disaster Worst item ever","x":"The lipgloss base was halfway full. There was also hair inside of my lipgloss base. This is disgusting and I wouldnt recommend this to someone that wants a clean product. Will be switching back to tkb After receiving the replacement the 2nd one was open lip gloss base all over the package. Will never order again.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-22","r":1.0,"t":"Hate it Hate it Hate it","x":"I wish I would have read the reviews This is more like water than a lip gloss base ... extremely thin I do not like It ... would not recommend nor will I purchase again","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great product \ud83d\udc4c","x":"Bought this for a little girl who wanted to start a business making her own lip gloss to earn some extra money during the Summer. She loved it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0982TYDMK-24","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible base","x":"This **** is terrible. It\u2019s very oily and watery. Save your money and get the tkb Versagel. Lipgloss business owners beware!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the bag much smaller than expected for the price, calling it a rip off or poor value.","cites":[3,5,6,13]},{"text":"Despite the small size, several reviewers say a little goes a long way and one or two bags fill many tubes.","cites":[2,10,11]},{"text":"Reviewers praise the base itself as smooth, glossy, easy to mix, and not sticky or chunky.","cites":[2,7,10,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the base is not thick enough or not as glossy as they prefer.","cites":[4,8,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the packaging is flimsy or arrived damaged.","cites":[5,7]}]},"qa":[]}